{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001818331","cik":"0001818331","slug":"genedx-holdings-818331","name":"GeneDx Holdings Corp.","ticker":"WGS","exchanges":["Nasdaq","Nasdaq"],"sector":"Services-Health Services","sic":"8000","country":"CT","website":"","listed_years":5.3,"first_annual":"2021-03-30","last_filing":"2026-07-28","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001818331&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["GeneDx Holdings Corp. files with the SEC under \"Services-Health Services\", based in CT, and has been publicly reporting for 5 years.","It reported $408.8m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 17.4% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 66.7%.","Listed on Nasdaq, Nasdaq, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 22 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 17.4% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $102.3m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818331/000181833126000041/0001818331-26-000041-index.htm","accession":"0001818331-26-000041"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in 7 of the last 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818331/000181833126000041/0001818331-26-000041-index.htm","accession":"0001818331-26-000041"},{"text":"Gross margin of 66.7% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818331/000181833126000041/0001818331-26-000041-index.htm","accession":"0001818331-26-000041"},{"text":"Net cash of $74.0m against total assets of $506.3m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818331/000181833126000041/0001818331-26-000041-index.htm","accession":"0001818331-26-000041"}],"bear":[{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-56.2% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818331/000181833126000041/0001818331-26-000041-index.htm","accession":"0001818331-26-000041"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $52.9m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818331/000181833126000041/0001818331-26-000041-index.htm","accession":"0001818331-26-000041"},{"text":"About 22 months of cash at the current burn ($170.7m against $94.2m a year). A company that must raise is a company that raises on the buyer's terms.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818331/000181833126000041/0001818331-26-000041-index.htm","accession":"0001818331-26-000041"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 5.8% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (19,135 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818331/000195524226000011/0001955242-26-000011-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.1% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1818331/000195524226000011/0001955242-26-000011-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 59.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.59,"cons